<title>USA: Ford raises quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Ford raises quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co.  said Thursday its board of directors voted to increase the automaker's quarterly dividend to 42 cents a share, from 38.5 cents previously.</p>
<p>Ford Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Alex Trotman said the increase, the sixth since the first quarter of 1994, reflects continued improvement in the company's operations from higher automotive margins and lower costs.</p>
</text>
